<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/18th-century">18th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1795</h1><p class="ref-lede">1795 in world history: 23 events, 13 births, 12 deaths, 7 states founded and 11 that came to an end. 1,283 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
