<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Crisis</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/third-partition-of-poland">Third Partition of Poland</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Third Partition of Poland was the final division of the remaining territory of the Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth among Russia, Prussia and Austria in 1795.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Campaign</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/french-revolutionary-occupation-of-the-netherlands">French revolutionary occupation of the Netherlands</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The French revolutionary occupation of the Netherlands took place in 1795, when French armies overran the Dutch Republic and established the Batavian Republic.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-muizenberg" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-muizenberg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-muizenberg">Battle of Muizenberg</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Muizenberg was fought near Cape Town from August to September 1795, when a British expedition attacked the Dutch Cape Colony to keep the sea route to India from France after the Netherlands fell to the French Republic.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-krtsanisi" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-krtsanisi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-krtsanisi">Battle of Krtsanisi</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Krtsanisi was fought on 11 September 1795 near Tbilisi between the Qajar army of Agha Mohammad Khan and the much smaller Georgian force of Erekle II of Kartli-Kakheti.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-nuuanu" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-nuuanu.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-nuuanu">Battle of Nuʻuanu</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Nuʻuanu was fought on Oʻahu in May 1795, when Kamehameha I, armed with Western guns and advisers, defeated Kalanikūpule, ruler of Oʻahu and Maui.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-greenville" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/treaty-of-greenville.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Treaty · Peace</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-greenville">Treaty of Greenville</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Treaty of Greenville was signed on 3 August 1795 at Fort Greenville, in present-day Ohio, between the United States and the nations of the Western Confederacy after their defeat at the Battle of Fallen Timbers.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-the-hague-1795" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/treaty-of-the-hague-1795.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Treaty</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-the-hague-1795">Treaty of The Hague (1795)</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Treaty of The Hague was signed on 16 May 1795 between the French Republic and the new Batavian Republic.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-kharda" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-kharda.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-kharda">Battle of Kharda</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Kharda was fought in March 1795 near Kharda in the Deccan between the Maratha Confederacy and the army of Nizam Ali Khan of Hyderabad.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Treaty · Peace</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/peace-of-basel-1795">Peace of Basel (1795)</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Peace of Basel was the set of treaties of 1795 by which Prussia, Spain and Hesse-Kassel made peace with revolutionary France.</p></div></li></ol></section>
